        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Cream-colored silk damask, full loom width, with selvedges on either side.  Straight laurel branches form a diamond-shaped network, with eight-pointed stars at the intersections.  In each diamond-shaped compartment is a bee, seen from above.  A few very small stains.  Lower left corner worn and frayed."@en ;
